  {
   "question": "6",
   "part": "a",
   "latex": "$$\\begin{aligned}1000&=6000e^{-6k}\\\\\\dfrac{1}{6}&=e^{-6k}\\\\\\dfrac{\\ln\\frac{1}{6}}{-6}&=k\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$\\therefore k=0.29862\\ldots$\n\n$k=0.2986$ (4 d.p.)",
   "marks_breakdown": "2 marks",
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
   "question": "6",
   "part": "b",
   "latex": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\dfrac{dI}{dd}&=-0.2986\\times 6000e^{-0.2986d}\\\\&=-0.2986\\,(I)\\end{aligned}$$\n\nWhen $d=6$, $I=1000$: $\\dfrac{dI}{dd}=-0.2986\\times 1000=-298.6\\approx 299$ lux/m\n\n(At $d=6$, $\\dfrac{dI}{dd}=-0.2986\\times 6000\\times e^{-0.2986\\times 6}=-298.6$)",
   "marks_breakdown": "2 marks",
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
   "question": "7",
   "part": null,
   "latex": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\log_a\\dfrac{\\sqrt{12}}{a}&=\\log_a\\sqrt{12}-\\log_a a\\\\&=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\log_a(4\\times 3)-1\\\\&=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left[\\log_a 4+\\log_a 3\\right]-1\\\\&=\\dfrac{1}{2}(p+q)-1\\end{aligned}$$\n\n(or equivalent)",
   "marks_breakdown": "2 marks",
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
   "question": "8",
   "part": null,
   "latex": "$$\\begin{aligned}x&=5te^{-3t}\\\\v&=5t(-3)e^{-3t}+e^{-3t}(5)\\quad\\text{(by product rule)}\\\\v&=-15te^{-3t}+5e^{-3t}\\\\\\therefore v&=5e^{-3t}(-3t+1)\\end{aligned}$$\n\nParticle is at rest when $v=0$\n\n$\\Rightarrow 5e^{-3t}\\neq 0$ so no solution.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}-3t+1&=0\\\\t&=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$\\therefore$ Particle at rest after $\\dfrac{1}{3}$ min (or 20 sec)",
   "marks_breakdown": "2 marks",
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
